291	 * Retry a FAILED NxCloud instance whose backing VM never came up. Re-enqueues a
292	 * PROVISION job on the same Server (the provision handler keeps any persisted
293	 * vmid, so a retry resumes rather than leaking a second VM) and moves both the
294	 * instance and its server back into the transitional PROVISIONING state so the
295	 * dashboard shows "setting up" instead of the failed card. Owner/admin only,
296	 * guarded to FAILED. Mirrors retryHostingProvision / retryProvision.
